# pihole-peek — extra category rules for the html report.
# Copy to "categories" next to the script, or point --categories at it.
#
#   <category>   <regex>
#
# One rule per line. The regex is case insensitive and it is tested against the
# whole domain. Everything after a '#' is a comment.
#
# These rules are tried BEFORE the built-in ones, so they win: name a category
# that already exists to extend it, or invent a new one.

# extend a built-in category
#smarthome    my-thermostat|my-doorbell\.local

# invent a category of your own
#printer      brother|epsonconnect|hpeprint
#nas          synology|qnap|truenas
#car          teslamotors|mercedes-benz|vw-connect

# force a domain the built-in rules read the wrong way
#streaming    ^cdn-0\.example-video\.com$
